     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div><br><br><br><br>On Friday, February 27, 2015 at 7:47:30 AM UTC+8, Dan Linden wrote:<blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0;margin-left:0.8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex\"><div dir=\"ltr\">Hi Brian, make sure your observation-level columns are labeled with a separator between the name and number:<br><br>y.1 y.2 y.3<br>date.1 date.2 date.3<br><br>If you do this, your original csvToUMF call should work.<br></div></blockquote></div></div>"
